(6180583, 912769, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, Im not quite sure what I am seeing here. Is it ice crystals forming on a dead plant? It feels like the ocus is just a bit off, which is maybe why I cannot tell what it is.</td>', 'Hmmm, Im not quite sure what I am seeing here. Is it ice crystals forming on a dead plant? It feels like the ocus is just a bit off, which is maybe why I cannot tell what it is.', '2010-10-04 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180584, 912699, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of the years gone past. Great details, and I like how you picked a large-ish depth of field.</td>', 'Nice depiction of the years gone past. Great details, and I like how you picked a large-ish depth of field.', '2010-10-04 11:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180585, 912644, 114225, '<td valign="top">IS that a drillhead in the vodka? This is an interesting photo, with the swirly. But the lake of sharp focus is hurting it.</td>', 'IS that a drillhead in the vodka? This is an interesting photo, with the swirly. But the lake of sharp focus is hurting it.', '2010-10-04 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180586, 912762, 114225, '<td valign="top">I had to look up what this was, so I''m glad you included the art form in the title. Nice rendition of this are. You can really see all the minute dots created.</td>', 'I had to look up what this was, so I''m glad you included the art form in the title. Nice rendition of this are. You can really see all the minute dots created.', '2010-10-04 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180587, 911946, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool "action scene." I do wish we could see a bit more of the mantis, it took me a while to find it in the shot.</td>', 'Cool "action scene." I do wish we could see a bit more of the mantis, it took me a while to find it in the shot.', '2010-10-04 11:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180588, 912641, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I really enjoy when you can see all the facial details in animals. Great sharpness and composition.</td>', 'Very cool. I really enjoy when you can see all the facial details in animals. Great sharpness and composition.', '2010-10-04 11:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180589, 912748, 114225, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet effective. I like the composition (not having the entire bulb in the photo,and the silhouette feel.</td>', 'Simple, yet effective. I like the composition (not having the entire bulb in the photo,and the silhouette feel.', '2010-10-04 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180590, 911779, 114225, '<td valign="top">This had some high potential for being really good. The colors and lighting are well done. It''s too bad there is so much noise.</td>', 'This had some high potential for being really good. The colors and lighting are well done. It''s too bad there is so much noise.', '2010-10-04 11:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180592, 912701, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum. That''s really cool how some of the sprinkles do look like they are glowing. IS that just due to overexposure?</td>', 'Yum. That''s really cool how some of the sprinkles do look like they are glowing. IS that just due to overexposure?', '2010-10-04 11:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180593, 912535, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with making a droplet shot interesting. The angle and large amount of splash is what really makes this photo nice.</td>', 'Nicely done with making a droplet shot interesting. The angle and large amount of splash is what really makes this photo nice.', '2010-10-04 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180595, 912806, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of a sucker for the color palette in this photo, it''s just really cool to me how many details it brings out, while still having a bit of mystery.</td>', 'I''m kind of a sucker for the color palette in this photo, it''s just really cool to me how many details it brings out, while still having a bit of mystery.', '2010-10-04 11:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180597, 912773, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the details captured and the centered composition. However, I can''t help but wonder if I would like it even more with a square crop (more balance).</td>', 'Well done. I like the details captured and the centered composition. However, I can''t help but wonder if I would like it even more with a square crop (more balance).', '2010-10-04 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180598, 912813, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool how the depth of field in this makes each flower unique.</td>', 'Very cool how the depth of field in this makes each flower unique.', '2010-10-04 11:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180599, 912814, 114225, '<td valign="top">This has a cool "brain" feel to it. It''s too bad there is so much noise in the background, with is really taking away from the overall photo.</td>', 'This has a cool "brain" feel to it. It''s too bad there is so much noise in the background, with is really taking away from the overall photo.', '2010-10-04 11:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180602, 912131, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a nice subject, I think it''s just missing some key pieces to really do well. I would have preferred it more if you got even tighter (seeing the details in the stone would be cool). Also, to make the focus feels just a bit off. Maybe that''s because the focus point is near the back of the stone.</td>', 'This is a nice subject, I think it''s just missing some key pieces to really do well. I would have preferred it more if you got even tighter (seeing the details in the stone would be cool). Also, to make the focus feels just a bit off. Maybe that''s because the focus point is near the back of the stone.', '2010-10-04 11:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180603, 911604, 114225, '<td valign="top">Haha! Very good fake macro shot :)</td>', 'Haha! Very good fake macro shot :)', '2010-10-04 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180606, 912401, 114225, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color and focus to this shot. What an interesting flower!</td>', 'Brilliant color and focus to this shot. What an interesting flower!', '2010-10-04 11:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180608, 912744, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I''m betting this is a vent in the floor for central heating/cooling. Do I win a prize?<br/>As for the photo, nice lighting and perspective to make a dull subject very interesting.</td>', 'Hmm, I''m betting this is a vent in the floor for central heating/cooling. Do I win a prize?As for the photo, nice lighting and perspective to make a dull subject very interesting.', '2010-10-04 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
