(6180652, 912492, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the setup you used, but the lighting feels a little bit off. I see a few blown out highlights in reflections, and the blueish cast on the front raspberry feels weird. I think a softer direction light could have helped (just guessing, especially not knowing the actual setup of the shot).</td>', 'I like the setup you used, but the lighting feels a little bit off. I see a few blown out highlights in reflections, and the blueish cast on the front raspberry feels weird. I think a softer direction light could have helped (just guessing, especially not knowing the actual setup of the shot).', '2010-10-04 12:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
