(6180799, 912810, 113419, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I consider this macro for me it''s more of an abstract but I do so love the colors in this abstract.  And they have been put together very well in this image.</td>', 'Not sure that I consider this macro for me it''s more of an abstract but I do so love the colors in this abstract.  And they have been put together very well in this image.', '2010-10-04 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
