(6180804, 912640, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good idea. Too bad there is so much blur. If this were sharper, it would be be pretty cool.</td>', 'A good idea. Too bad there is so much blur. If this were sharper, it would be be pretty cool.', '2010-10-04 15:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
