(6180806, 911980, 113419, '<td valign="top">I can see where your going with this; but I don''t think it''s quite there just yet.  For me this is more about bokeh than macro.</td>', 'I can see where your going with this; but I don''t think it''s quite there just yet.  For me this is more about bokeh than macro.', '2010-10-04 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
