(6180808, 912799, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a good attempt, but just falls a bit short on the focus. You picked a nice composition, came up with a sleak/attractive border, and have good lighting If only it was focused better..</td>', 'This is a good attempt, but just falls a bit short on the focus. You picked a nice composition, came up with a sleak/attractive border, and have good lighting If only it was focused better..', '2010-10-04 15:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180809, 912805, 113419, '<td valign="top">looks as if it''s trying to hide it''s face - good job!</td>', 'looks as if it''s trying to hide it''s face - good job!', '2010-10-04 15:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180810, 912607, 113419, '<td valign="top">beautiful, perfect colors and lighting!</td>', 'beautiful, perfect colors and lighting!', '2010-10-04 15:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180812, 912758, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool mix of colors. I am definitely wondering how it''s done, but I am going to guess that paint was dropped into a fish tank full of water which is lit very brightly. Then the photo was flipped to add interest.</td>', 'Very cool mix of colors. I am definitely wondering how it''s done, but I am going to guess that paint was dropped into a fish tank full of water which is lit very brightly. Then the photo was flipped to add interest.', '2010-10-04 15:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
