(6180815, 911916, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the ideas you have put together for this. The dark background definitely distinguishes your subject, you have pretty good lighting, and the S-curve is a nice touch. It''s too bad there is so much noise in the bristles, if those were in sharp focus, that would have made this even better.</td>', 'I like the ideas you have put together for this. The dark background definitely distinguishes your subject, you have pretty good lighting, and the S-curve is a nice touch. It''s too bad there is so much noise in the bristles, if those were in sharp focus, that would have made this even better.', '2010-10-04 15:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180816, 912392, 113634, '<td valign="top">very cool capture</td>', 'very cool capture', '2010-10-04 15:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
