(6180826, 912592, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very unusual, with so many great elements, but I feel this just misses the mark somehow.  Perhaps it''s the pov (angle too shallow), or the crop (too wide), or maybe it needs a bit more contrast, or convert to b/w.  Or maybe the shadow would be more dynamic if it was more diagonal towardsthe right.</td>', 'Very unusual, with so many great elements, but I feel this just misses the mark somehow.  Perhaps it''s the pov (angle too shallow), or the crop (too wide), or maybe it needs a bit more contrast, or convert to b/w.  Or maybe the shadow would be more dynamic if it was more diagonal towardsthe right.', '2010-10-04 15:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180828, 912736, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. How is the top mushroom light up? IS that just a reflection from a strobe?</td>', 'Very cool. How is the top mushroom light up? IS that just a reflection from a strobe?', '2010-10-04 15:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180842, 912647, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOVE this.  Not normally associating graininess with bubbles, but it really works here.</td>', 'LOVE this.  Not normally associating graininess with bubbles, but it really works here.', '2010-10-04 15:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
