(6180851, 912759, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oooohhhh!!!!  A minimalist macro.  I love how this sort of image makes me want to make up a story.</td>', 'Oooohhhh!!!!  A minimalist macro.  I love how this sort of image makes me want to make up a story.', '2010-10-04 15:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180852, 912733, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool! these look like they belong underwater (are they?). Nice tight cop and good angle choice.</td>', 'Very cool! these look like they belong underwater (are they?). Nice tight cop and good angle choice.', '2010-10-04 15:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180855, 912666, 96751, '<td valign="top">All I can think of is FRONT PAGE!!  FABULOUS all around.  Incredible detail, terrific energy, very creative, technically great.  But a couple of things come to mind - that must be one very large snail (based on the depth of the step, next to the grass), and I''m guessing the skateboard is somehow suspended?  Marvelous!</td>', 'All I can think of is FRONT PAGE!!  FABULOUS all around.  Incredible detail, terrific energy, very creative, technically great.  But a couple of things come to mind - that must be one very large snail (based on the depth of the step, next to the grass), and I''m guessing the skateboard is somehow suspended?  Marvelous!', '2010-10-04 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6180856, 912774, 113419, '<td valign="top">this image is so nice!  love the colors and it''s so different - very nice!  I''d make a nice big print, frame and hang it!</td>', 'this image is so nice!  love the colors and it''s so different - very nice!  I''d make a nice big print, frame and hang it!', '2010-10-04 15:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
