(6180963, 912632, 101702, '<td valign="top">Just when I thought I was completely bored of water drop shots, this one grabs me by the ears and smacks me upside the head. Fantastic re-envisioning of this staple image. I predict a ribbon.</td>', 'Just when I thought I was completely bored of water drop shots, this one grabs me by the ears and smacks me upside the head. Fantastic re-envisioning of this staple image. I predict a ribbon.', '2010-10-04 17:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6181090, 912535, 59796, '<td valign="top">Hope you didn''t waste real beer trying to get this shot. :P<br/> <br/>Very nicely done. The crown shadow in the background is a little distracting, but it''s a nit - the first impression is a ''wow!'' My top 5 in this round.</td>', 'Hope you didn''t waste real beer trying to get this shot. :P Very nicely done. The crown shadow in the background is a little distracting, but it''s a nit - the first impression is a ''wow!'' My top 5 in this round.', '2010-10-04 18:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6181095, 912632, 59796, '<td valign="top">I have absolutely no idea how to get a multi-colored crown so clean - I would love to be able to get something that remotely looks like this. Must''ve been a lot of flashes and cleanups for this one. Brilliant - Get''s my blue for sure. I have to say it again - Brilliant!</td>', 'I have absolutely no idea how to get a multi-colored crown so clean - I would love to be able to get something that remotely looks like this. Must''ve been a lot of flashes and cleanups for this one. Brilliant - Get''s my blue for sure. I have to say it again - Brilliant!', '2010-10-04 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6181099, 912758, 59796, '<td valign="top">What in the world! Are those paint drops dancing in thin air? All those colors and patterns are just too cool. Can''t even begin to imagine how to set up anything like this. Very unique. I hope this gets a ribbon.</td>', 'What in the world! Are those paint drops dancing in thin air? All those colors and patterns are just too cool. Can''t even begin to imagine how to set up anything like this. Very unique. I hope this gets a ribbon.', '2010-10-04 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
