(6183344, 912040, 120171, '<td valign="top">Too bright at the top of the shot, i find it a bit hard on the eye.</td>', 'Too bright at the top of the shot, i find it a bit hard on the eye.', '2010-10-06 13:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183347, 912758, 120171, '<td valign="top">Each drop appears to have its own fice, love the colours.</td>', 'Each drop appears to have its own fice, love the colours.', '2010-10-06 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183351, 912419, 120171, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2010-10-06 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183355, 912701, 120171, '<td valign="top">A number of sprinkles are too bright and distract from what is a good image.</td>', 'A number of sprinkles are too bright and distract from what is a good image.', '2010-10-06 13:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183362, 912424, 101702, '<td valign="top">Water drop type images have been done to death and I usually struggle to find them appealing, but this one is a fantastic shot. Something a little different. The contrast of full white against full balck, tempered by the orange through red to brown really helps lift the image. I''m thinking this is a ribbon contender - though if there was 1 tiny thing I would change, it would be the trio of relections on the leading edge of the cup, as I find my eye drawn to them. It would be interesting to see how it looks without those tiny hot spots. Of course, that is just being nitpicky.</td>', 'Water drop type images have been done to death and I usually struggle to find them appealing, but this one is a fantastic shot. Something a little different. The contrast of full white against full balck, tempered by the orange through red to brown really helps lift the image. I''m thinking this is a ribbon contender - though if there was 1 tiny thing I would change, it would be the trio of relections on the leading edge of the cup, as I find my eye drawn to them. It would be interesting to see how it looks without those tiny hot spots. Of course, that is just being nitpicky.', '2010-10-06 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183365, 912766, 101702, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit</td>', 'Beautifully lit', '2010-10-06 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183369, 912666, 101702, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot. My pick for the blue (otherwise known as the kiss of death). The concept and creativity puts my effort to shame.</td>', 'Outstanding shot. My pick for the blue (otherwise known as the kiss of death). The concept and creativity puts my effort to shame.', '2010-10-06 14:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6183376, 912640, 101702, '<td valign="top">The bit on the right hand side is a distraction. Perhaps a square crop just arund the eye would be better? Could do with being in better focus though.</td>', 'The bit on the right hand side is a distraction. Perhaps a square crop just arund the eye would be better? Could do with being in better focus though.', '2010-10-06 14:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
