(6184023, 912795, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=58785" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">FocusPoint</a> and Sox?<br/> <br/>Yes, this shot is awsome (if you don''t say so yourself).  It''s a pity about the flash glare - or is that just the overhead light bouncing of your head<br/>;-)<br/> <br/>A couple of questions if I may.  Is that a left handed camera?  Oh, yeh, image "validated" so it really is your reflection.  Couldn''t you have repositioned yourself and your cat to remove the door an put youself in more light?  It''s not as if this sort of shot is hard to get? (JK)<br/> <br/>I originally gave this an 8 and was tossing up whether to bump to 10 to acknowledge such photographer awsomeness or to slash it to 4 because of the OOF upper eyelid - so it stays at 8.  Cheers.</td>', 'I''m guessing  FocusPoint and Sox? Yes, this shot is awsome (if you don''t say so yourself).  It''s a pity about the flash glare - or is that just the overhead light bouncing of your head;-) A couple of questions if I may.  Is that a left handed camera?  Oh, yeh, image "validated" so it really is your reflection.  Couldn''t you have repositioned yourself and your cat to remove the door an put youself in more light?  It''s not as if this sort of shot is hard to get? (JK) I originally gave this an 8 and was tossing up whether to bump to 10 to acknowledge such photographer awsomeness or to slash it to 4 because of the OOF upper eyelid - so it stays at 8.  Cheers.', '2010-10-06 22:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
