(6188090, 912758, 91372, '<td valign="top">i''m simply speechless. this is incredible. the creativity and science behind the setup just blows my mind.</td>', 'i''m simply speechless. this is incredible. the creativity and science behind the setup just blows my mind.', '2010-10-11 02:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188093, 912650, 114969, '<td valign="top">The focus plane is perfect! Fantastic catch, congratulations on your well-deserved ribbon :-)</td>', 'The focus plane is perfect! Fantastic catch, congratulations on your well-deserved ribbon :-)', '2010-10-11 02:15:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188096, 912650, 25190, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue wonderful image :)</td>', 'Congrats on the blue wonderful image :)', '2010-10-11 02:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188119, 912666, 96751, '<td valign="top">You are one seriously creative and talented guy.  Congrats on such a fun and well-done image!</td>', 'You are one seriously creative and talented guy.  Congrats on such a fun and well-done image!', '2010-10-11 03:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188120, 912767, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just marvelous!</td>', 'Just marvelous!', '2010-10-11 03:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188121, 912680, 96751, '<td valign="top">I truly thought this would be on the fp.  It is just so beautiful.</td>', 'I truly thought this would be on the fp.  It is just so beautiful.', '2010-10-11 03:08:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188127, 912650, 110108, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue<br/> <br/>great photo</td>', 'Congrats on the blue great photo', '2010-10-11 03:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188133, 912017, 40391, '<td valign="top">Well, I thought it was great!  Different for this challenge (though done before) but what I really liked was the colourful (correct spellying for you Yanks) bokeh that you achieved.  At first I thought the focal points may have been a bit off with the SDoF but after a longer review I felt it was just about right.  Anyway, you got an 8 from me, and a bit of a surprised look for not finishing higher.<br/> <br/>BTW, would never had guessed this was yours.</td>', 'Well, I thought it was great!  Different for this challenge (though done before) but what I really liked was the colourful (correct spellying for you Yanks) bokeh that you achieved.  At first I thought the focal points may have been a bit off with the SDoF but after a longer review I felt it was just about right.  Anyway, you got an 8 from me, and a bit of a surprised look for not finishing higher. BTW, would never had guessed this was yours.', '2010-10-11 03:36:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188140, 911535, 30364, '<td valign="top">I still like all the faults  including the absent apostrophe which I''d like to think was inevitable.</td>', 'I still like all the faults  including the absent apostrophe which I''d like to think was inevitable.', '2010-10-11 03:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188143, 912333, 40391, '<td valign="top">I do enjoy a nice sharp macro.  However, I also enjoy a beautiful photo that captures a story, emotion and especially in this case, great colours (amongst other things).  The spider husks were a great find and you shot them, not in a documentary style, but artistically.  I gave this a seven and felt it should have been in the top 30.</td>', 'I do enjoy a nice sharp macro.  However, I also enjoy a beautiful photo that captures a story, emotion and especially in this case, great colours (amongst other things).  The spider husks were a great find and you shot them, not in a documentary style, but artistically.  I gave this a seven and felt it should have been in the top 30.', '2010-10-11 03:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188145, 912818, 116649, '<td valign="top">Did I forget to write anything about this?  I gotta stop doing 11th hour entries!</td>', 'Did I forget to write anything about this?  I gotta stop doing 11th hour entries!', '2010-10-11 04:13:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188149, 912666, 25190, '<td valign="top">Congrats very clever shot</td>', 'Congrats very clever shot', '2010-10-11 04:18:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188151, 912767, 25190, '<td valign="top">Great work with the frog what a great model he/she was even if you have to freeze :)</td>', 'Great work with the frog what a great model he/she was even if you have to freeze :)', '2010-10-11 04:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6188168, 912650, 67145, '<td valign="top">AWESOME .. !!<br/>congrats on such a brilliant shot and the blue ..<br/>and far out nilesh .. thankyou so much for the dedication .. i''m humbled .. :)</td>', 'AWESOME .. !!congrats on such a brilliant shot and the blue ..and far out nilesh .. thankyou so much for the dedication .. i''m humbled .. :)', '2010-10-11 05:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
