(6188216, 912767, 60614, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Robin,  I knew it would end up on the front page somewhere.  Love the photo more since I know the story behind this little guys brief modeling stint.  If he only knew he is on the front page.  Intead he is too busy looking for his next meal and keeping warm.  Fantastic.</td>', 'Congratulations Robin,  I knew it would end up on the front page somewhere.  Love the photo more since I know the story behind this little guys brief modeling stint.  If he only knew he is on the front page.  Intead he is too busy looking for his next meal and keeping warm.  Fantastic.', '2010-10-11 07:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
