(6189631, 912758, 86322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dleach:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice interpretation:<br/><a href="//gizmodo.com/5658483/watch-these-colors-dance-then-see-how-it-was-done" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//gizmodo.com/5658483/watch-these-colors-dance-then-see-how-it-was-done</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Believe it or not, I did not see this video before I made this photo. I actually found this idea in a photo magazine. Great video nevertheless.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-12 18:00:12.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by dleach: Very nice interpretation://gizmodo.com/5658483/watch-these-colors-dance-then-see-how-it-was-done   Believe it or not, I did not see this video before I made this photo. I actually found this idea in a photo magazine. Great video nevertheless.', '2010-10-12 18:59:54.000000', '2010-10-12 19:00:12.000000', 0),
