(6194255, 912652, 28359, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club :-) <br/> <br/>My first reaction to your image was "Love it". Great shallow DOF, the colors/tones work very well together. The composition of the main subject is right on. I''m not big on boarders but with this type of crop it works well. I feel it meets the challenge requirements, it appears some felt a little different and that is what brought the score down. Yet the description stated close up shot. Wonderful image..Nice work!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club :-)  My first reaction to your image was "Love it". Great shallow DOF, the colors/tones work very well together. The composition of the main subject is right on. I''m not big on boarders but with this type of crop it works well. I feel it meets the challenge requirements, it appears some felt a little different and that is what brought the score down. Yet the description stated close up shot. Wonderful image..Nice work!', '2010-10-18 00:32:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6194707, 912814, 53814, '<td valign="top">and if you look closely at the tree skeletons you will see more poppy skeletons growing beneath them. Recursive skeletons?<br/>Color works well to provide the overall life/death contrast. <br/> <br/></td>', 'and if you look closely at the tree skeletons you will see more poppy skeletons growing beneath them. Recursive skeletons?Color works well to provide the overall life/death contrast.  ', '2010-10-18 12:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
