(6261471, 912732, 25190, '<td valign="top">Hi Sofia,<br/>         Just a comment on your image seen that no one could bother and mark you with a low score i feel there isnt enough lighting for a start the composition i think could have been better the focus is pretty good i would have rotated the image either 90 degrees and have the leaf comming from another angle maybe use the rule of the third here i feel its too centre(sorry we spell different in australia..lol) hope these comments where helpful for your next marco shot ..Gord</td>', 'Hi Sofia,         Just a comment on your image seen that no one could bother and mark you with a low score i feel there isnt enough lighting for a start the composition i think could have been better the focus is pretty good i would have rotated the image either 90 degrees and have the leaf comming from another angle maybe use the rule of the third here i feel its too centre(sorry we spell different in australia..lol) hope these comments where helpful for your next marco shot ..Gord', '2010-12-26 04:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
